OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,7,Fsome bright or sunny intervals and
OL,8,Fjust a few passing showers. Brisk
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear periods and the odd
OL,12,Fshower this evening. Then the rest of
OL,13,Fthe night be mainly dry with variable
OL,14,Famounts of cloud, the odd shower
OL,15,Facross the south.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FAfter a dry start widespread
OL,18,Frain, occasionally heavy, will spread
OL,19,Fnortheast during the morning. Drier
OL,20,Fand clearer weather will spread from
OL,21,Fthe west by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
